<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Reset Your Password — SH Tour</title>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      background: #f0ede8;
      font-family: 'DM Sans', Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      padding: 40px 16px;
    }

    .wrap {
      max-width: 540px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* ── Top label ── */
    .top-label {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: .14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #085041;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    /* ── Card ── */
    .card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 32px rgba(8,80,65,.10), 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
    }

    /* ── Hero banner ── */
    .hero {
      background: #085041;
      padding: 36px 40px 32px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -40px; right: -40px;
      width: 200px; height: 200px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(29,158,117,.18);
    }
    .hero::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -60px; left: 60px;
      width: 140px; height: 140px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(29,158,117,.12);
    }

    .hero-brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .brand-badge {
      width: 36px; height: 36px;
      background: #1D9E75;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #fff;
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      letter-spacing: .04em;
    }
    .brand-name {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #E1F5EE;
      letter-spacing: .02em;
    }
    .brand-tagline {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: #9FE1CB;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero-icon {
      width: 56px; height: 56px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
    }
    .hero-icon svg { width: 26px; height: 26px; }

    .hero-title {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 26px;
      color: #ffffff;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
    }
    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #9FE1CB;
      line-height: 1.6;
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
    }

    /* ── Body ── */
    .body {
      padding: 36px 40px;
    }

    .greeting {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #374151;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .greeting strong {
      color: #085041;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .message {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #6B7280;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    /* ── CTA Button ── */
    .cta-wrap {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .cta-btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #085041;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: .04em;
      padding: 14px 36px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      transition: background .2s;
    }

    /* ── Divider ── */
    .divider {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }

    /* ── Info box ── */
    .info-box {
      background: #F9FAFB;
      border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
      border-left: 3px solid #1D9E75;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .info-icon {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }
    .info-icon svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
    .info-text {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #6B7280;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .info-text strong {
      color: #374151;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    /* ── Fallback link ── */
    .fallback {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #9CA3AF;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .fallback a {
      color: #085041;
      word-break: break-all;
    }

    /* ── Footer ── */
    .footer {
      background: #085041;
      padding: 20px 40px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .footer-brand {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #9FE1CB;
    }
    .footer-text {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #5DCAA5;
      text-align: right;
    }

    /* ── Bottom note ── */
    .bottom-note {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #9CA3AF;
      margin-top: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .hero, .body { padding: 28px 24px; }
      .footer { padding: 18px 24px; flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
      .footer-text { text-align: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="top-label">SH Tour · Account Security</div>

    <div class="card">

      <!-- Hero -->
      <div class="hero">
        <div class="hero-brand">
          <div class="brand-badge">SH</div>
          <div>
            <div class="brand-name">SH Tour</div>
            <div class="brand-tagline">Your journey, our passion</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/>
            <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-title">Password Reset<br>Request</div>
        <div class="hero-sub">We received a request to reset the password for your account.</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Body -->
      <div class="body">

        <p class="greeting">Hello, <strong><%= name %></strong></p>

        <p class="message">
          Someone requested a password reset for the SH Tour account associated
          with this email address. If this was you, click the button below to
          choose a new password. The link will expire in <strong
          style="color:#085041">10 minutes</strong>.
        </p>

        <div class="cta-wrap">
          <a href="<%= resetUILink %>" class="cta-btn">Reset My Password</a>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider">

        <div class="info-box">
          <div class="info-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1D9E75" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="info-text">
            <strong>Didn't request this?</strong>
            If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this
            email. Your password will remain unchanged and no action is needed.
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="fallback">
          If the button above doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>
          <a href="<%= resetUILink %>"><%= resetUILink %></a>
        </p>

      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class="footer">
        <div class="footer-brand">SH Tour</div>
        <div class="footer-text">
          &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> SH Tour. All rights reserved.<br>
          support@shtour.com
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="bottom-note">
      This email was sent to you because a password reset was requested.<br>
      If you have concerns, contact us at support@shtour.com
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
